Z||000004||SwissFormula||12-08-2001||05:50 PM||||Its always nice to get positive feedback, thank you, thank you  <IMG SRC="http://www.stopstart.btinternet.co.uk/sm/notworthy.gif"> <P>I <B>love</B> the ole 400ci Pontiac engine. I had a '78 SE TransAm, with a 400 in it. I was not very happy with the stock 220hp so i installed an Isky cam, Holley carb, the RAIII heads from a '69 Firebird HO, and a real dual exhaust. The car was a <B>killer!</B> I used to smoke BMW's and Porsche's (non turbos) on the Autobahn... Too bad i had to sell it, i needed the money to buy the GTO. A friend of a friend owns it now, maybe i should ask him for a ride next year  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>to be continued...<BR><P>------------------<BR>Roy<P>88 Formula, T-Top<BR>1 of 20 Fieros in Switzerland||||reg||7
Z||000005||GTFiero1||12-09-2001||02:16 AM||||my step brother got a 68 GTO. he has been in the military for the past couple of years out in CA and just came back yesterday night, drove cross-country. i cant wait to ride in it. it looks nice, no rust, no bondo. not the original engine though but is a pontiac 400 but with less horse power  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  but he plans to fix that...<P>------------------<BR>Adam J. B.<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero_3.jpg">   <BR>you gotta keep on keepin on...<BR>IM AOL: GTFiero &  Rumpdetective (dont ask)||||reg||1
Z||000006||SwissFormula||12-09-2001||05:49 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by GTFiero1:<BR><B>not the original engine though but is a pontiac 400 but with less horse power   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  but he plans to fix that...<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>an engine with less horse power? in a GTO?!?<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fwtf.gif">  eeeek!<BR>oh well its a pontiac engine at least, so it could have been worse. please have that fixed, your car just told me today it wants a stronger engine as a christmas gift  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>almost forgotten: do you have pics of it?<P>------------------<BR>Roy<P>88 Formula, T-Top<BR>1 of 20 Fieros in Switzerland||||reg||1
